        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Lime from lithium carbonate hydration</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Lime from lithium carbonate hydration
The multioutput-process "lithium carbonate hydration" delivers the co-products lime and lithium hydroxide. The allocation is based on stoechiometric calculation.;
UUID: 7c78cc4a-f857-37c2-8725-5f26677e377d
Hydration of lithium carbonate including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world..
Technology: Hydration of lithium carbonate
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7c78cc4a-f857-37c2-8725-5f26677e377d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
